[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:Can I Help You, Madam?]
[00:13.46]Did the woman get what she wanted?
[00:18.71]A woman in jeans stood at the window of an expensive shop.
[00:24.27]Though she hesitated for a moment,
[00:26.65]she finally went in and asked to see a dress that was in the window.
[00:32.74]The assistant who served her did not like the way she was dressed.
[00:38.13]Glancing at her scornfully, he told her that the dress was sold.
[00:45.14]The woman walked out of the shop angrily and decided to punish the assistant next day.
[00:53.30]She returned to the shop the following morning dressed in a fur coat,
[00:59.34]with a handbag in one hand and a long umbrella in the other.
[01:04.95]After seeking out the rude assistant,
[01:08.23]she asked for the same dress.
[01:11.61]Not realizing who she was,
[01:13.67]the assistant was eager to serve her this time.
[01:17.50]With great difficulty, he climbed into the shop window to get the dress.
[01:24.76]As soon as she saw it,
[01:26.45]the woman said she did not like it.
[01:29.72]She enjoyed herself making the assistant bring almost everything in the window
[01:34.85]before finally buying the dress she had first asked for.
